    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Campbells Auctioneers are delighted to present this traditional cottage together with an attractive parcel of land extending to approximately 10.18 acres to the open market.\n\nSituated in the townland of Cloughwally, Lettermacaward, Co. Donegal, the property enjoys a convenient roadside location just off the N56, while benefiting from the peace and beauty of the surrounding countryside.\n\nThe property comprises an old cottage in need of refurbishment together with approximately 10.18 acres of adjoining land, offering excellent potential for those seeking a restoration project, smallholding, or countryside retreat.\n\nThe location is ideally positioned within easy reach of Lettermacaward Village, Dungloe Town, and the many attractions of Donegal`s renowned Wild Atlantic Way. \n\nThe location offers the perfect balance of rural tranquillity and accessibility, making it an ideal base from which to enjoy all that West Donegal has to offer.\n\nThis represents a unique opportunity to acquire a property with character and substantial acreage in a sought-after part of West Donegal.\n\nFor further information or to arrange a viewing, please contact Campbells Auctioneers.\n\nOur Ref: K1241\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Living Room - 4.08m (13'5\") x 3.65m (12'0\")\n\nBedroom 1 - 4.08m (13'5\") x 4.02m (13'2\")\n\nKitchen - 4.08m (13'5\") x 3.65m (12'0\")\n\nStorage 1 - 3.92m (12'10\") x 3.59m (11'9\")\n\nStorage 2 - 3.72m (12'2\") x 3.03m (9'11\")\n\nNotice\nPlease note we have not tested any apparatus, fixtures, fittings, or services. Interested parties must undertake their own investigation into the working order of these items. All measurements are approximate and photographs provided for guidance only."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "<ul><li> Approx. 10.18 Acres of Land </li><li> Excellent Restoration Potential </li><li> Convenient Location</li></ul>"
      },
      {
